rustdesk-server (1.1.16-sctg.2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * fix: a request with a malformed bearer token no longer aborts hbbs
  * fix: --logged-in-only answers the client when the API server cannot be reached, and follows --api-port
  * the release profile unwinds on panic instead of aborting
  * end-to-end tests of hbbs in the CI

rustdesk-server (1.1.16-sctg.1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * first release of the monorepo (server, API server and web console, client overlay)
  * based on upstream rustdesk-server 1.1.16, hbb_common as a git submodule
  * TCP key exchange version 1 (--require-kx-v1 refuses legacy clients)
  * the 32-bit ARM binaries and the .deb packages are no longer produced

